WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,420
Here comes another fool

2
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,420
With so many stores, which one should I go to?

3
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:17,420
I just came to recognize the old man’s shop.

4
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,420
Who in the whole street doesn’t know that this old man is the most greedy?

5
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,420
Other stores at least have some authenticity.

6
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,420
This old man's shop is famous for selling high-quality imitation goods.

7
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,420
Just wait for him to be slaughtered

8
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,420
Young people want something

9
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,420
Bronze, calligraphy and painting, drum arms, etc.

10
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,420
I have everything here and the price is absolutely fair

11
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,420
I want to buy some premade decorations

12
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,420
Can you give me a recommendation? The price shouldn’t be too expensive.

13
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,420
It's too expensive and I can't afford it

14
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:35,420
Come on, come on, take a look at these.

15
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,420
Most of these are polished and made by Zong Lingyu

16
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,420
Great feel, just for the cost

17
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,420
Plus design fee

18
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,420
If you want 200 yuan, pick one of these

19
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,420
If you buy it at a higher price
